<title>UK: Lubecker Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Lubecker Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LUBECER HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **24.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UND	 LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE 24.SEP.97 WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 4.65 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
